  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support Programme for Biodiversity Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The programme will leverage additional finance for biodiversity conservation, through support for the implementation of National Biodiversity Finance Plans, including improving domestic resource mobilization for biodiversity, reforming harmful subsidies, testing innovative finance tools such as biodiversity certificates and support pipelines for nature-positive blended funds.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
